-- Optional full catalog seed generated from the real local database.
--
-- Copy this file to app/db/full_catalog.sql, replace this example content with
-- exported INSERT statements for the articles table, then commit full_catalog.sql
-- when you want Render's free demo database to contain the full catalog.
--
-- Required workflow:
-- 1. Generate app/db/full_catalog.sql from your local instance/manga.sqlite.
-- 2. Verify referenced images exist in app/static.
-- 3. Run: python -m pytest tests/test_deploy_static_assets.py
